{
  "title": "Wiki Session End Summary",
  "description": "When the agent stops, check if wiki pages were modified this session and prompt to update the hot cache with a summary of changes.",
  "event": "agent_stop",
  "action": "agent_prompt",
  "instruction": "Check if any wiki pages were modified this session by running: git diff --name-only HEAD 2>/dev/null | grep '^wiki/'. If wiki pages were changed, update wiki/hot.md with a brief summary of what changed (under 500 words). Use the hot cache format: Last Updated, Key Recent Facts, Recent Changes, Active Threads. Keep it factual. Overwrite the file completely. It is a cache, not a journal."
}
